sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant A as DustSweep app
    participant B as Backend
    participant W as Wallet
    participant P2 as Permit2
    participant R as Sweep router

    A->>B: POST /build-tx (routes, output, deadline, nonce)
    B-->>A: Typed data + approval requirements (spender = Permit2)
    opt First time per token
        A->>W: approve(Permit2, exact amount) per token
        W->>U: Approval prompt(s) — "Setup"
        U-->>W: Confirm
    end
    A->>W: signTypedData: PermitBatchWitnessTransferFrom
    W->>U: Readable message — exact tokens & amounts,<br/>spender = router, nonce, 30-min deadline,<br/>witness binds routes + output + recipient + minOut + fee
    U-->>W: Sign (gas-free)
    A->>B: POST /build-tx again, with signature
    B-->>A: Final sweep calldata (real ABI)
    A->>W: eth_sendTransaction → router
    W->>R: sweep(Permit2Signature, routes, params, permit, sig)
    R->>R: Recompute witness from actual routes/params
    R->>P2: permitWitnessTransferFrom(owner = msg.sender)
    P2->>P2: Verify signature, nonce unused, deadline ok,<br/>witness hash matches
    P2->>R: Transfer EXACT amounts in
    Note over R: Any tampering with routes, recipient,<br/>minOut, or fee ⇒ hash mismatch ⇒ revert
